*0** · two determinism passes **0** · clean scratch repo `make validate`, `regenerate-check` ×2, `release-check VERSION=1.0.0-rc.5` all **0** · boundary probe **0** on Go 1.25.1 and 1.25.5, all five expected-red controls failed as required.\n\n**Reported red, because it is:** in-worktree `git diff --exit-code` exits **1** (`make regenerate-check` exits 2) — the whole candidate is uncommitted against `57c1f56`. Determinism established by snapshot comparison and the clean git-init probe instead.\n\nNothing staged, committed, published, or pinned. `protocol/core.md`, `profiles/manager.md`, `SECURITY.md`, every schema and `toolchain_gate.py` untouched this cycle.","ttft_ms":1974,"ttft_stream_ms":1463,"time_to_request_ms":15,"type":"result","duration_ms":1781056,"uuid":"d0cc775b-e1ae-48e8-b15a-49f2f3316a26"}
